# value-quoted-hash-inside

## Input

```
msg "before # after"

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..21
  ENTRY@0..21
    WORD_KEY@0..3
      WORD@0..3 "msg"
    SPACE@3..4 " "
    QUOTED_STRING@4..20
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@4..5 "\""
      STRING@5..19 "before # after"
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@19..20 "\""
    NEWLINE@20..21 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..3 "msg",
            },
            value: QuotedString {
                open_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@4..5 "\"",
                string: STRING@5..19 "before # after",
                close_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@19..20 "\"",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

